{"about_the_game":"Have you ever dream to sit in your isolated room and contemplate your broken mind? Yeah... This game won't help you cure it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a simulation of how bad a person reacts to isolation. It may be scary, it contains horror elements, but the point is to experience a mind going wild in the isolated space.<br />\r\nThis is only a prototype, not a full vertical slice of a game. The whole thing should take you no more than 20 minutes, you may experience weird noises, anxiety and mirages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd one thing more, the experience can be different for each individual. Do not panic.<br />\r\nIf you feel dizzy or you experience rising heartbeat, please turn off this game by simple tapping Escape button.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Yellow Emperor Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/8d466b718b57f913bdb2a3bf9ba71b63d8da020f.jpg"},{"name":"Quarantine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/feacb6b129c4e8b7f4fe84af6008de3e7f067f39.jpg"},{"name":"Enter Isolation Room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/1ee705e52731b849b63b5c79e4d1530a0f8e5704.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/51594c9d3b73588f38a67594cd681b831a11feb4.jpg"},{"name":"Chill a little","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/149b3c2eb296e836e1fb1a7a44b8db1b2028a9b3.jpg"},{"name":"Solitude","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/8a373812562f938e069c5fd591e556abe747a946.jpg"},{"name":"Phantom Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/78f6b30d5b9234266e3d4a051907b1c9becc21cb.jpg"},{"name":"Black Widow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1338430/b1508f